---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '') || '';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <strong>「두 엔트로피」</strong> · Kirchhoff–Shannon Bridge<br />
      <span>한국어 심화 미니 코스 · {year}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <a href={`${base}/path/`}>학습 경로</a> ·
      <a href={`${base}/glossary/`}>용어집</a> ·
      <a href={`${base}/lab/`}>실험실</a> ·
      <a href="https://github.com/YgHnSIM/kirchhoff-shannon-bridge">GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-warn">경고: S ≠ H · 열역학 엔트로피 ≠ 섀넌 엔트로피</div>
  </div>
</footer>
